# PLATFORM-14 · 001-product-family-catalog · the committed error-catalog snapshot.
#
# One line per catalog member: code|http-status|comma-separated parameter names.
# java-backend-api, "The catalog is snapshotted and diffed": the error catalog is API surface a
# structural OpenAPI diff cannot see, so adding, removing or re-typing a code is a git-visible
# re-approval. This file is the diff target. Regenerating it to make a test pass is the failure
# it exists to prevent — a change here is a change to the committed contract's ErrorCode enum.
CURSOR_INVALID|400|
FAMILY_CODE_DUPLICATE|409|
FAMILY_CODE_INVALID|400|
FAMILY_NAME_INVALID|400|
FAMILY_NOT_FOUND|404|
INTERNAL_ERROR|500|correlationId
LIMIT_ABOVE_MAXIMUM|400|violation,min,max
STATUS_FILTER_INVALID|400|
